    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d901">

                <pb facs="0817" n="701" xml:id="pg701"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/15189.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Silliman
                        to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-10T17:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 10, 1915—5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s June 5, 10 a.m. Foreign Office to-day expresses General Carranza’s
                    thanks and states that there is no reply.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
